# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fast_boot.lua with a valid NVRAM (NVPREP=600 boots
# the unmodded game once first, as a game that has been run before). boot_probe.lua logs the
# frame on which the first process (attract mode) starts. Without the script (measured with
# boot_probe.lua alone): frame 60 on the T-unit games, 375 on the Wolf-unit games. With it:
# 5 and 210. (With the full ROM sets, sound included, the Wolf-unit games go from 217 to 52.)
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fast_boot.lua
extra boot_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbamht nbahangt
frames 1000
env NVPREP=600
once fast boot: power-on wait shortened
nolog fast boot: error prompt
nbajamte: once attract at 5
nbajamse: once attract at 5
nbajam: once attract at 5
nbamht: once attract at 210
nbahangt: once attract at 210
